{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113334","id":3055790913,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62I6tB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113334","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113334.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113334.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113334","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113334/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113334/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113334/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/83b245a84decab6cde7cfb62eac21f1e58932e03","number":113334,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix VoxelGI glossy reflection artifacts","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #50842\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Seems to fix #84746 too.\r\n\r\n## Visual Comparisons\r\n\r\nGodot 4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"1105\" height=\"828\" alt=\"testscene-stable-4 5\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c20857f-aa29-4887-94a3-8bc2b146f312\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"1105\" height=\"828\" alt=\"testscene-fixed\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2150b605-da53-4d78-a98f-c462df2fe360\" />\r\n\r\nGodot 4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"bistro2-stable-4 5\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0c40cbb-6f32-493b-a123-f2ea17de906c\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"bistro2-fixed\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20137587-2b05-49b1-a95b-68e8ec76d952\" />\r\n\r\nGodot 4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"1225\" height=\"828\" alt=\"bistro-stable-4 5\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f18202d-5914-4c3c-9cb4-fd57e42ec287\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"1225\" height=\"828\" alt=\"bistro-fixed\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4d3dd9a-b345-495b-acef-c61f3315f844\" />\r\n\r\n## Performance Comparisons\r\n\r\nPerformance test scene 1: Bistro with fully static VoxelGI and a spinning cube.\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"bistro-with-cube\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3d761a2-a97e-43c6-b9dd-71f11103738d\" />\r\n\r\nPerformance test scene 2: Bistro with fully static VoxelGI, spinning cube, and large mirror.\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"bistro2-with-cube\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06732179-be34-4aea-bad5-75c6763398a4\" />\r\n\r\nScene 1 benchmark results:\r\n- 4.5-stable: 97fps\r\n- PR: 96fps\r\n- 4.5-stable (6 cones): 81fps\r\n- PR (6 cones): 79fps\r\n\r\nScene 2 benchmark results:\r\n- 4.5-stable: 92fps\r\n- PR: 89fps\r\n- 4.5-stable (6 cones): 78fps\r\n- PR (6 cones): 75fps\r\n\r\nSetup:\r\n- 1920x1080 exclusive fullscreen\r\n- AMD RX570 4GB\r\n- Linux X11, Mesa RADV drivers 25.0.7\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the VoxelGI reflection issue visible in the screenshots above (issue #50842), by making comparisons to voxel alpha during cone tracing more strict.\r\n\r\nI'm not too sure *why* this works, it's something that I tried to see if it'd fix the problem, and it did, so I decided to open this PR.\r\n\r\nThere is a performance loss from running the loop more times (due to stricter stop conditions), but overall the performance loss seems negligeable, at least on my hardware.\r\n\r\n(testing scene in the first set of images is the VoxelGI test scene from [Calinou's VoxelGI oversampling PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/55419), with an added light so that reflections wouldn't be completely black)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","ur